[center][color=#aaaaaa]NEXT LEVEL: ESPORTS GAME DEV CHALLENGE 2026[/color][/center]

[center][b][color=#66aaff][font_size=22]MoyveTeam[/font_size][/color][/b]
[b]Cebu Institute of Technology - University[/b][/center]

[b][color=#ffd700]I. TEAM COMPOSITION[/color][/b]
[table=2]
[cell][b]Christian V. Buzarang[/b] (BSCS - 3)[/cell][cell] - Team Leader & Game Developer[/cell]
[cell][b]Hanz Ivan L. Hermosada[/b] (BSIT - 3)[/cell][cell] - Game Designer[/cell]
[cell][b]Ericka Fatima Reign R. Ligaray[/b] (BSCS - 3)[/cell][cell] - Narrative Designer[/cell]
[cell][b]Kaye Akira H. Regulacion[/b] (BSME CS - 2)[/cell][cell] - Quality Assurance Tester[/cell]
[cell][b]Rea Emerald G. Sabellita[/b] (BSCS - 3)[/cell][cell] - Game Artist[/cell]
[/table]

[b][color=#ffd700]II. ADVISER / COACH[/color][/b]
[b]Catherine N. Arellano[/b] - Faculty, Computer Science
[i]Cebu Institute of Technology - University[/i]

[b][color=#ffd700]III. SPECIAL THANKS & ATTRIBUTIONS[/color][/b]
[b]Game Engine:[/b] Godot Engine 4.5.1
[b]Programming Language:[/b] GDScript
[b]Isometric Chess Sprites:[/b] Nikoicho 
[b]Background Music:[/b] ilyas_ananas 
[b]Sound Effects:[/b] Kenney.nl 
[b]AI Consultation:[/b] Gemini

[center]
[color=#55ff55]\"The grid is no longer a prison; it is a blank canvas.\"[/color]
[/center]"
